@keycloak = http://localhost:8180/realms/shifts/protocol/openid-connect/token
@api = http://localhost:8080/api

### Login com ADMIN
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{keycloak}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=shift-dev&username=admin.teste&password=Teste@123

### Login com PROFISSIONAL
# @name loginMedico
POST {{keycloak}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=shift-dev&username=medico.teste&password=Teste@123

### 1. Sem token (esperado: 401)
GET {{api}}/shift-templates

### 2. Quem sou eu (ADMIN)
GET {{api}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.access_token}}

### 3. Profissional consulta turnos (esperado: 200)
GET {{api}}/shift-templates
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.access_token}}

### 4. Profissional tenta criar turno (esperado: 403)
POST {{api}}/shift-templates
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMedico.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ 
    "name":"Teste",
    "startTime": "08:00",
    "endTime": "12:00"
}

### 5. ADMIN cria turno (esperado: 201)
POST {{api}}/shift-templates
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Manhã 6h",
    "startTime": "0:00",
    "endTime": "14:00"
}

### 6. Get usuário validando cadastro no Keycloak - Quem sou eu users
GET {{api}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.access_token}}

### 7. Atualizar
PUT {{api}}/shift-templates/7
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Manhã 6h (ajustado)",
  "startTime": "09:00",
  "endTime": "15:00"
}